<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,248,243)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="34" width="500" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>02  研究目标</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="54" width="720" height="36"><content textType="body" fontSize="23" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.1" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>从“安全专用模型”出发：一条被真实问题逼出来的路线</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="96" width="36" height="3"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="92" topLeftY="97" width="814" height="1"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(220,224,228)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="516" width="420" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>Nivis · 基于大语言模型的代码安全分析系统</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="840" topLeftY="516" width="66" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="right" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>08 / 30</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="110" width="600" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>立项判断 · 漏洞检测的三代技术路线</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="128" width="258" height="86" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect"