"10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>免人工规则</p><p>但依赖大量标注，跨项目泛化差、黑盒</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="658" topLeftY="128" width="258" height="86" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,240,224)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="658" topLeftY="128" width="4" height="86" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="672" topLeftY="138" width="232" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>第三代 · 大语言模型</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="672" topLeftY="158" width="232" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>语义理解与风险推理</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="672" topLeftY="176" width="232" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>能力足够强，但开放生成不可控</p><p>云端贵、代码不能出域——我们的机会</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="224" width="852" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>我们的起点：训练一个 16GB 显存可跑的安全专用 8B 模型；随后每一步都由上一阶段暴露的真实问题驱动</p></content></shape><line startX="96" startY="316" endX="860" endY="316"><border color="rgb(196,206,214)" width="2"/></line><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="88" topLeftY="308" width="16" height="16"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill><border color="rgb(250,248,243)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="10" topLeftY="244" width="172" height="54" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="20" topLeftY="250" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>起点</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="20" topLeftY="264" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>安全专用 8B</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="20" topLeftY="282" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>本地可跑、补通用模型安全短板</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="10" topLeftY="330" width="172" height="72" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(233,242,240)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="20" topLeftY="338" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>目标</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="20" topLeftY="352" width="158" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>精准检测 · 自动化 · 本地部署，三条硬目标贯穿始终</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="279" topLeftY="308" width="16" height="16"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill><border color="rgb(250,248,243)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="201" topLeftY="244" width="172" height="54" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="211" topLeftY="250" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>问题 1</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="211" topLeftY="264" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>开放生成失控</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="211" topLeftY="282" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>高误报 0.154、不可复现、成本高</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="201" topLeftY="330" width="172" height="72" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="211" topLeftY="338" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="211" topLeftY="352" width="158" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>两阶段：工具召回 + 封闭裁决</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="308" width="16" height="16"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill><border color="rgb(250,248,243)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="392" topLeftY="244" width="172" height="54" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="402" topLeftY="250" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>问题 2</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="402" topLeftY="264" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>训练不涨归因</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="402" topLeftY="282" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>SFT 只学会格式，CPT 知识注入负迁移</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="392" topLeftY="330" width="172" height="72" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="402" topLeftY="338" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="402" topLeftY="352" width="158" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>方法分层：知识走 RAG、判别走证据</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="661" topLeftY="308" width="16" height="16"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill><border color="rgb(250,248,243)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="583" topLeftY="244" width="172" height="54" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="593" topLeftY="250" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>问题 3</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="593" topLeftY="264" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>云端依赖</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="593" topLeftY="282" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>隐私出域、调用昂贵</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="583" topLeftY="330" width="172" height="72" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="593" topLeftY="338" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="593" topLeftY="352" width="158" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>双教师蒸馏 8B，百元本地跑</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="852" topLeftY="308" width="16" height="16"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill><border color="rgb(250,248,243)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="774" topLeftY="244" width="172" height="54" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="784" topLeftY="250" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>问题 4</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="784" topLeftY="264" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>信任与落地</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="784" topLeftY="282" width="158" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>误报回填污染、无候选会漏网</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="774" topLeftY="330" width="172" height="72" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="784" topLeftY="338" width="158" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="784" topLeftY="352" width="158" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>信任层 + 全栈产品化</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="424" width="852" height="56" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(31,46,56)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="424" width="4" height="56" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="434" width="400" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9.5" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>META-METHOD · 贯穿全程的元方法</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="454" width="820" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>路线不是先验规划：先判问题属于数据、模型、架构还是工程哪一层，再选对应方法——而不是换模型、堆参数碰运气。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>立项时我们判断：规则工具不懂语义，深度学习方案跨项目泛化差，而大模型第一次同时具备语义理解和风险推理能力，所以起点是做一个 16G 显存可跑的安全专用 8B 模型。但路线不是规划出来的。问题一，让模型开放式找漏洞，误报 0.154、不可复现，应对是改成工具召回加封闭裁决的两阶段；问题二，SFT 只学会输出格式、继续预训练知识注入两次失败，应对是按任务分层，知识走 RAG、判别靠证据；问题三，云端又贵又有隐私风险，应对是双教师蒸馏到 8B 本地；问题四，模型记忆会被误报污染、无候选文件会漏检，应对是 2.5 代信任层，并把它做成全栈产品。元方法是：先定位问题属于哪一层，再动手。</p></content></note></slide>